# A window in a wall
#
# Created by Bernie Roehl, November 1992

# The dimensions of the wall are 100 by 100, with the window 
# bottom edge being 50 off the ground and 35 from the top, and
# the left and right edges of the window being 35 from the nearest
# wall edge.

# The colors 0x8001 and 0x8002 are the "front" and "back" colors of the
# wall; the colors 0x8003 and 0x8004 are the "front" and "back" colors of
# the window glass.

window 12 10

0 0 0
0 100 0
25 100 0
75 100 0
100 100 0
100 0 0
75 0 0
25 0 0
25 75 0
75 75 0
75 50 0
25 50 0

# wall, side 1
0x8001 4 0 1 2 7
0x8001 4 2 3 9 8
0x8001 4 3 4 5 6
0x8001 4 6 7 11 10

# wall, side 2
0x8002 4 7 2 1 0
0x8002 4 8 9 3 2
0x8002 4 6 5 4 3
0x8002 4 10 11 7 6

# glass, side 1
0x8003 4 8 9 10 11

# glass, side 2
0x8004 4 11 10 9 8

# End of window.plg
